{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217590","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217590","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1621759001:1":{"text":"我明白了！古董镜被施加了那种古老的召唤魔法，向镜子祈祷的人，就会召唤出自己的分身。","source_cn":"我明白了！古董镜被施加了那种古老的召唤魔法，向镜子祈祷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDB4AD5CA4FA2045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621759002:1":{"text":"魔镜中产生意识的分身，就是<style=\"highlight\">镜中人</style>！镜中人有着强大的魔力，会从镜子里出来，并取代那个向镜子祈祷的人！","source_cn":"魔镜中产生意识的分身，就是<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C9206B80E9D42E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621759003:1":{"text":"有……有人召唤出了镜中人吗？","source_cn":"有……有人召唤出了镜中人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9770A14BD059BF7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621759004:1":{"text":"吉罗德……","source_cn":"吉罗德……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92DE33D7152B9F5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621759005:1":{"text":"刚刚<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的话提醒了我。镜像的特性，不就是看着一模一样，但都与原本的人完全相反吗？","source_cn":"刚刚<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2CF7F8936DFA594E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"刚刚<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的话