","source_cn":"是因为这本小说，还有那个商铺老板的宣传词吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F92FE05E3E97FBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621759011:1":{"text":"小说给了吉罗德灵感，老板说“启示之镜”能够提升灵性与魔力，估计他听完就想试一下……","source_cn":"小说给了吉罗德灵感，老板说“启示之镜”能够提升灵性与魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87351455C30EE78B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621759012:1":{"text":"没想到“启示之镜”只是个幌子，他被召唤出的镜人替代了。","source_cn":"没想到“启示之镜”只是个幌子，他被召唤出的镜人替代了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8E559015737CC9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621759013:1":{"text":"等等！如果镜中人替代了吉罗德，那真正的吉罗德又在哪里？难道……难道他还在镜子里？","source_cn":"等等！如果镜中人替代了吉罗德，那真正的吉罗德又在哪里？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x525CD75CDC0BC46E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621759014:1":{"text":"……没错，我明白了！怪不得吉罗德坚持要毁掉那面古董镜！","source_cn":"……没错，我明白了！怪不得吉罗德坚持要毁掉那面古董镜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CBE8F41C70D6E6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1621759015:1":{"text":"赛琳明白什么了？","source_cn":"赛琳明白什么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x602ED776878